{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42939","headline":"侍宴赋得起坐弹鸣琴二首 一 · 杨希道","name":"侍宴赋得起坐弹鸣琴二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北林鹊夜飞，南轩月初进。\n调弦发清徵，荡心怯褊恡。\n变作离鸿声，还入思归引。\n长叹未终极，秋风飘素鬓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨希道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}